2026-05-07 20:10:56 [deepseek-v4] colour subcarrier frequency is 4.43 MHz while pixel rate is ~16.65 MHz, giving ~3.76 subcarrier
2026-05-07 20:10:56 [deepseek-v4] cycles per pixel. The code uses a constant count of 1999 (if `colorWords=128` → count=2031?). This
