2026-05-07 20:20:00 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-05-07 20:20:00 [deepseek-v4] - vidbit.pio: Main video timing PIO program generating syncs (vertical, horizontal), back
2026-05-07 20:20:00 [deepseek-v4] porch, active video (864 pixels per line), and front porch for 625-line PAL at 166.5 MHz system
2026-05-07 20:20:00 [deepseek-v4] clock.
