2026-05-07 20:20:00 [deepseek-v4] optionally integrates chroma, teletext (WST), I2S audio, and PS/2 keyboard reading.
2026-05-07 20:20:00 [deepseek-v4] - monobit.cpp/h: Frame buffer definitions and drawing routines (character font, lines,
2026-05-07 20:20:00 [deepseek-v4] rects) for a 864×576 monochrome image with separate even/odd field arrays.
