2026-05-07 20:52:41 [deepseek-v4] Without these changes, the chroma output will be both incorrectly timed and unsynchronised with the
2026-05-07 20:52:41 [deepseek-v4] video frame, resulting in flicker, wrong colours, or complete signal loss.
