2026-05-11 19:54:28 [deepseek-v4] construction looks correct. But note that the teletext header and body functions use `out32[i]`
2026-05-11 19:54:28 [deepseek-v4] with 4 bytes packed into a uint32. However, the WST data is output via DMA to the PIO TX FIFO. The
2026-05-11 19:54:28 [deepseek-v4] PIO program `wst.pio` (not shown) presumably shifts out bits. Need to ensure bit order (LSB first
2026-05-11 19:54:28 [deepseek-v4] or MSB first). The code uses LSB‑first for Hamming and parity, but the packing might need
2026-05-11 19:54:28 [deepseek-v4] byte‑reversal for the PIO. Check.
