2026-05-11 19:54:28 [deepseek-v4] `getchar` or from an IRQ depending on implementation. The use of `getchartimeoutus(0)`
2026-05-11 19:54:28 [deepseek-v4] inside the callback suggests it’s polling the UART, which might be okay but could cause high CPU
2026-05-11 19:54:28 [deepseek-v4] usage. Better to use interrupt‑driven UART with a ring buffer.
