2026-05-11 19:54:28 [deepseek-v4] - `sin4` table: Precomputed float sin table for 4096 entries, but then you define a `sin()`
2026-05-11 19:54:28 [deepseek-v4] function that uses it. That’s fine, but note that `float sin(float r)` has the same name as the
