2026-05-11 19:57:40 [claude-opus-4-7] front porch 258) looks like a refined version. The `mov isr,32` to stash the pixel counter for
2026-05-11 19:57:40 [claude-opus-4-7] reuse in `mov y,isr` per line is a nice trick to avoid burning FIFO entries on a per-line counter.
