2026-05-11 21:07:14 [gemini-3.1-pro] A note on `.fifo txget`
2026-05-11 21:07:14 [gemini-3.1-pro] Because you are using `.fifo txget` in your `colorfifo.pio`, the RP2350 hardware reconfigures the
2026-05-11 21:07:14 [gemini-3.1-pro] FIFO routing. Calling `piosmput_blocking` (which targets the TX FIFO from the CPU's
2026-05-11 21:07:14 [gemini-3.1-pro] perspective) correctly populates the memory that the SM will access when it executes `mov osr,
2026-05-11 21:07:14 [gemini-3.1-pro] rxfifo[y]`. This is a very clean setup for a static palette.
2026-05-11 21:07:14 [gemini-3.1-pro] 
