2026-05-11 21:20:08 [gemini-3.1-pro] function, the pump is initialized on `pio1` (passed in as `pio`), while the four color FIFOs are
2026-05-11 21:20:08 [gemini-3.1-pro] hardcoded to initialize on `pio2`. This is a perfectly valid use of the RP2350's three PIO blocks,
