2026-05-17 18:38:23 [deepseek-v4] .define BACKPORCH_WAIT32 30
2026-05-17 18:38:23 [deepseek-v4] .define FRONTPORCH_WAIT32 8
2026-05-17 18:38:23 [deepseek-v4] ...
2026-05-17 18:38:23 [deepseek-v4]     jmp x--,line [6]          ; changed from [12] to [6]
2026-05-17 18:38:23 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-05-17 18:38:23 [deepseek-v4] 
