2026-05-18 14:36:30 [deepseek-v4]    - 1 word for line counter (for progressive: 624? i.e., 625 lines - 1)
2026-05-18 14:36:30 [deepseek-v4]    - 1 word for pixel counter (863)
2026-05-18 14:36:30 [deepseek-v4]    - 625 × 27 = 16875 words for pixel data
2026-05-18 14:36:30 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-05-18 14:36:30 [deepseek-v4]    Total `progressiveWordCount` = 1 + 32 + 1 + 1 + 16875 = 16910 words.
2026-05-18 14:36:30 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-05-18 14:36:30 [deepseek-v4]    (Adjust if your blanking lines include more or fewer lines; make sure the line count and number
2026-05-18 14:36:30 [deepseek-v4] of pixel data lines match.)
2026-05-18 14:36:30 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-05-18 14:36:30 [deepseek-v4] 2. Check that the pixel data for vertical blanking lines is present – The PIO will consume
2026-05-18 14:36:30 [deepseek-v4] 27 words for every line in the line loop, even during vertical blanking (lines after the active
2026-05-18 14:36:30 [deepseek-v4] video and before the next field). Your buffer must supply 27 words per line for all 625 lines.
2026-05-18 14:36:30 [deepseek-v4] 
