2026-05-18 14:36:30 [deepseek-v4] widths were chosen assuming 10656 cycles per line. If you change the line timing, the vsync pulse
2026-05-18 14:36:30 [deepseek-v4] lengths (in cycles) must be recalculated to maintain correct PAL vertical sync (5 equalising pulses
2026-05-18 14:36:30 [deepseek-v4] + 5 broad pulses + 5 equalising pulses). Currently you compute them based on 31965 cycles total?
