2026-05-18 20:01:20 [deepseek-v4] Overview
2026-05-18 20:01:20 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-05-18 20:01:20 [deepseek-v4] The `vidbit` system generates:
2026-05-18 20:01:20 [deepseek-v4] - PAL‑I or 288p composite video (via `vidbit.pio`).
2026-05-18 20:01:20 [deepseek-v4] - Optional chroma burst (`chroma.pio`) and World System Teletext (`wst.pio`).
