2026-05-18 20:01:20 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-05-18 20:01:20 [deepseek-v4] The main loop uses DMA to feed line data to the video PIO, and a USB CDC (TinyUSB) interface for
2026-05-18 20:01:20 [deepseek-v4] control and logging.
2026-05-18 20:01:20 [deepseek-v4] 
