2026-05-18 20:01:20 [deepseek-v4] component video. The PIO programs are clearly written and include comments.
2026-05-18 20:01:20 [deepseek-v4] - `vidbit.pio`: includes `.define` constants for timing. The sync widths are close to PAL spec
2026-05-18 20:01:20 [deepseek-v4] (≈4.7 µs HSYNC), but the exact count may be slightly off (see timing analysis below).
