2026-05-18 20:01:20 [deepseek-v4] call there. Usually `getchartimeoutus` on Pico uses the `stdio` mutex, which could cause
2026-05-18 20:01:20 [deepseek-v4] deadlock if called from an interrupt while the main loop holds the mutex. Consider using a separate
2026-05-18 20:01:20 [deepseek-v4] ring buffer.
