2026-05-19 18:54:06 [deepseek-v4] That adds 12 delay cycles after the front porch, making total front porch 258+12=270, sum = 10662 –
2026-05-19 18:54:06 [deepseek-v4] over budget by 6 cycles. You will need to adjust either the HSYNC/backporch/frontporch
2026-05-19 18:54:06 [deepseek-v4] widths or the line length. I suggest using a set of `.define` constants to compute the cycle count
