2026-05-19 18:54:06 [deepseek-v4] ### 2. IRQ synchronisation
2026-05-19 18:54:06 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-05-19 18:54:06 [deepseek-v4] Your pipeline uses IRQ flags for synchronisation:
2026-05-19 18:54:06 [deepseek-v4] 
