2026-05-19 18:54:06 [deepseek-v4] ## Suggestions for improvement
2026-05-19 18:54:06 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-05-19 18:54:06 [deepseek-v4] - **Separate timing constants** – define constants for each segment (HSYNC_CYCLES, BP_CYCLES, ACTIVE_CYCLES, FP_CYCLES) and verify sum = 10656.
2026-05-19 18:54:06 [deepseek-v4] - **Avoid `next` on single‑PIO block** – use `irq 0` without modifier.
2026-05-19 18:54:06 [deepseek-v4] - **Use FIFO joining** – if only TX is needed (e.g., threepin), join FIFOs to get 8‑deep TX.
