2026-05-22 20:58:47 [deepseek-v4] ≈ 9.3885, not 2.3471 – appears to be a factor of 4 off).
2026-05-22 20:58:47 [deepseek-v4] - Code style – The C++ is mostly procedural with many global variables. For a larger
2026-05-22 20:58:47 [deepseek-v4] project, encapsulation into classes and proper error handling would improve maintainability.
2026-05-22 20:58:47 [deepseek-v4] 
2026-05-22 20:58:47 [deepseek-v4] Overall, this is a sophisticated demo of the RP2350’s PIO and DMA capabilities, pushing the
2026-05-22 20:58:47 [deepseek-v4] boundaries of what can be achieved without dedicated video hardware. The combination of PAL,
2026-05-22 20:58:47 [deepseek-v4] teletext, colour lookup tables, and interactive I/O is impressive for a microcontroller.
